msgstr ""

msgid "Ami「......What is it?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, nothing......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, nada......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（If I'm not mistaken, it's Kawashima Ami＿the model...... Crap, I didn't realize I was＿staring.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Si no me equivoco, es Kawashima Ami,＿la modelo...... Rayos, no me di cuenta＿de que me quedé mirándola.）」"

msgid "Ami「Perhaps, you wanted to say you're＿mesmerized?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Acaso querías decir que＿quedaste fascinado?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué......」"

msgid "Ami「As if, huh? Tch!」"
msgstr "Ami「Como si fuera cierto, ¿no? ¡Tch!」"

msgid "Ami「Already done with your beloved＿cleaning～? You sure you can loaf＿around on a day like this～?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Ya terminaste con tu adorada limpieza～?＿¿Seguro que puedes andar holgazaneando＿en un día como hoy～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What about you, Kawashima-san......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y tú qué, Kawashima-san......?」"

msgid "Ami「\"Kawashima-san\"!?」"
msgstr "Ami「¡¿\"Kawashima-san\"?!」"

msgid "Ami「What's with you? It's kinda creepy, you＿know～?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué te pasa? Da un poco＿de miedo, ¿sabes～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Er, I mean......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehm, quiero decir......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Fuck...... What do I call her? Her＿surname without honorifics? Or＿maybe her given name?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Mierda...... ¿Cómo la llamo? ¿Por＿su apellido sin honoríficos? ¿O tal＿vez por su nombre de pila?）」"

msgid "Ami「You can call me Ami-chan like usual,＿you know～?」"
msgstr "Ami「Puedes llamarme Ami-chan＿como siempre, ¿sabes～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh, sorry, Ami-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah, perdón, Ami-chan.」"

msgid "Ami「Ugh! What the hell was that!?」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Agh! ¡¿Qué diablos fue eso?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's your deal?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué te pasa?」"

msgid "Ami「No, what's YOUR deal?」"
msgstr "Ami「No, ¿qué te pasa a TI?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Didn't you say I always call you that?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No dijiste que siempre te llamo así?」"

msgid "Ami「Well, that......」"
msgstr "Ami「Bueno, eso......」"

msgid "Ami「Come to think of it, Takasu-kun,＿weren't you acting a bit strange＿yesterday?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ahora que lo pienso, Takasu-kun, ¿no＿estabas actuando un poco raro ayer?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「R-Really?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿D-De verdad?」"

msgid "Ami「......Hey, say my name. Refer to me like＿you normally would.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Oye, di mi nombre. Llámame＿como lo harías normalmente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ami「You can't? Could it be that you forgot＿or something?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿No puedes? ¿Será que se＿te olvidó o algo así?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Ami「Then, did you also forget about, like,＿what happened that day?」"
msgstr "Ami「Entonces, ¿también se te olvidó,＿o sea, lo que pasó aquel día?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What are you talking about?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿De qué estás hablando?」"

msgid "Ami「The day when we last met...... Not＿yesterday. I mean Christmas Eve.」"
msgstr "Ami「El día en que nos vimos por última＿vez...... No ayer. Hablo de Nochebuena.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......W-What happened?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Q-Qué pasó?」"

msgid "Ami「Grr, you're so meannn.」"
msgstr "Ami「Grr, eres tan malooo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha......!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué......?!」"

msgid "Ami「Didn't you confess your love to me that＿day?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Acaso no me confesaste tu amor ese día?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I...... confessed to you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Yo...... me declaré a ti?」"

msgid "Ami「Yup. I was overjoyed①」"
msgstr "Ami「Sí. Me puse muy feliz①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Christmas Eve...... That reminds me,＿Taiga said......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Nochebuena...... Eso me recuerda＿que Taiga dijo......）」"

msgid "\"Do you remember what happened the＿night of Christmas Eve?\""
msgstr "\"¿Recuerdas lo que pasó en＿Nochebuena?\""

msgid "Ryuuji「（She was talking about this!?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡¿Se refería a esto?!）」"

msgid "Ami「......Hey, you really don't remember＿anything?」"
msgstr "Ami「......Oye, ¿de verdad no recuerdas nada?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Y-Yeah...... sorry......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「S-Sí...... lo siento......」"

msgid "Ami「............」"
msgstr "Ami「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「T-To be honest...... umm, I was＿hospitalized with the flu for a short＿while, and when I woke up......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-A decir verdad...... ehm, estuve＿hospitalizado un tiempo por gripe,＿y cuando desperté......」"

msgid "Ami「Your memory was gone? Is that it?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Perdiste la memoria? ¿Es eso?」"

msgid "Ami「Hmm, total memory loss...... Based on＿your actions, it would seem it's really＿true. Oho...... In-ter-es-ting.」"
msgstr "Ami「Mmm, pérdida total de memoria...... A＿juzgar por cómo actúas, parece que es＿verdad. Vaya...... In-te-re-san-te.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You sure believed me easily.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué fácil me creíste.」"

msgid "Ami「Whaaat～? But it's you, Takasu-kun.＿Like, of course I'd believe you.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Quéee～? Pero si eres tú, Takasu-kun.＿O sea, claro que te creo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ami「Stop ittt. If you stare like that,＿Ami-chan will get like, SO＿embarrassed.」"
msgstr "Ami「Basta yaaa. Si me miras así, a Ami-chan＿le va a dar, o sea, MUCHA vergüenza.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, s-sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, p-perdón.」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, well, to be honest I want to show＿you more, you know? Oh, but it's＿embarrassing, you know? Eek①」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah, bueno, la verdad quiero mostrarte＿más, ¿sabes? Pero qué vergüenza,＿¿sabes? ¡Ay!①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Which one is it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En qué quedamos?」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, you thought \"what a ditz\" just now,＿didn't you? Because I already know,＿okay?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ay, acabas de pensar \"qué tonta\",＿¿verdad? Porque ya lo sé, ¿de acuerdo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ami「Geez, I get that, like, all the time. I＿wonder why. I'm really not a ditz at all,＿but everyone says I am.」"
msgstr "Ami「Cielos, me dicen eso, o sea, todo el＿tiempo. Me pregunto por qué. En serio no＿soy nada tonta, pero todos lo dicen.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ditzy......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tonta......?」"

msgid "Ami「I really wonder why～ ......Like, what's＿wrong, Takasu-kun?」"
msgstr "Ami「Me pregunto por qué será～ ......O＿sea, ¿qué pasa, Takasu-kun?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What did I just get caught in......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿En qué me acabo de meter......?）」"

msgid "Ami「Don't - you - hold - back ① You can tell＿me.」"
msgstr "Ami「No - te - guardes - nada＿① Puedes decírmelo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, okay. First of all, what did I call＿you before?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, está bien. Primero que＿nada, ¿cómo te llamaba antes?」"

msgid "Ami「You always called me \"Kawashima\",＿Takasu-kun. But like, I really want you＿to call me Ami-chan.」"
msgstr "Ami「Siempre me llamabas \"Kawashima\",＿Takasu-kun. Pero, o sea, en serio＿quiero que me llames Ami-chan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then why did you say \"ugh\" earlier?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces, ¿por qué dijiste \"agh\" antes?」"

msgid "Ami「That was just because I was＿surprised～」"
msgstr "Ami「Eso fue solo porque me sorprendí～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Really?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En serio?」"

msgid "Ami「Like, any more questions? Ami-chan＿will answer anything for you,＿Takasu-kun. Eek①」"
msgstr "Ami「O sea, ¿alguna otra pregunta?＿Ami-chan te responderá lo que＿sea, Takasu-kun. ¡Ay!①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Let's see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Veamos......」"

msgid "Nothing in particular, I guess"
msgstr "Nada en especial, supongo"

msgid "Is it hard working for a magazine?"
msgstr "¿Es duro trabajar para una revista?"

msgid "Weren't you in a pro wrestling show?"
msgstr "¿No estuviste en un show de lucha libre?"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nothing in particular, I guess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nada en especial, supongo.」"

msgid "Ami「......Really?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿En serio?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ami「............」"
msgstr "Ami「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, bueno......」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, no, it's fine～ ① But Takasu-kun,＿like, seriously don't hold anything＿back, okay?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ay, no, está bien～ ① Pero Takasu-kun,＿o sea, en serio no te guardes＿nada, ¿sí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's just, I want to remember things＿myself if I can, rather than asking＿someone.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es solo que quiero recordar las＿cosas por mí mismo si puedo, en＿vez de preguntarle a alguien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（If I really confessed to Kawashima,＿then I have all the more reason to do＿so......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Si de verdad me declaré a Kawashima,＿entonces tengo aún más razones＿para hacerlo......）」"

msgid "Ami「I see. Like, SOOO admirable of you,＿Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ya veo. O sea, SÚÚÚPER admirable＿de tu parte, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Not really.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tampoco es para tanto.」"

msgid "Ami「Seems lonely to me, but don't feel＿down. I'm here for you, so fight!」"
msgstr "Ami「Me parece solitario, pero no te＿deprimas. Yo estoy aquí, ¡así que ánimo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima...... Thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kawashima...... Gracias.」"

msgid "Ami「Thanks for keeping me company＿today～ I had LOTS of fun!」"
msgstr "Ami「Gracias por hacerme compañía＿hoy～ ¡Me divertí MUCHÍSIMO!」"

msgid "Ami「See you later, Takasu-kun①」"
msgstr "Ami「Nos vemos luego, Takasu-kun①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, later.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, nos vemos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is it hard working for a magazine?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Es duro trabajar para una revista?」"

msgid "Ami「Yeah...... I mean, I'm not model-like at＿all, right?」"
msgstr "Ami「Sí...... O sea, no parezco modelo＿para nada, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ami「I'm not stylish, and there are other＿girls who look, like, WAY cuter than me.」"
msgstr "Ami「No tengo estilo, y hay otras＿chicas que se ven, o sea, MUCHO＿más lindas que yo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I disagree......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no estoy de acuerdo......」"

msgid "Ami「Thanks～ I'm happy even if it's just,＿like, flattery.」"
msgstr "Ami「Gracias～ Me alegra aunque＿sea, o sea, puro halago.」"

msgid "Ami「Although I have no self-confidence at＿all, I love working as a model.」"
msgstr "Ami「Aunque no tengo nada de confianza＿en mí misma, me encanta trabajar＿de modelo.」"

msgid "Ami「I get to wear so many lovely outfits,＿and learn about fashion as well①」"
msgstr "Ami「Puedo usar tantos atuendos preciosos＿y también aprender sobre moda①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Amazing...... And you're only in high＿school.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Increíble...... Y apenas estás＿en la preparatoria.」"

msgid "Ami「I think you're the amazing one,＿Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Ami「Yo creo que el increíble＿eres tú, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ami「Aren't you SUPER skilled at cooking＿and cleaning? I admire that. I've always＿thought I should follow your example①」"
msgstr "Ami「¿No eres SÚPER bueno cocinando y＿limpiando? Admiro eso. Siempre pensé＿que debería seguir tu ejemplo①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's not that big of a deal......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es la gran cosa......」"

msgid "Ami「Hey, do you have any other questions?」"
msgstr "Ami「Oye, ¿tienes alguna otra pregunta?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Let me see...... Nope, at least for now......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A ver...... No, al menos por ahora......」"

msgid "Ami「......Really?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿En serio?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ami「............」"
msgstr "Ami「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, bueno......」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, no, it's fine～ ① But Takasu-kun,＿like, seriously don't hold anything＿back, okay?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ay, no, está bien～ ① Pero Takasu-kun,＿o sea, en serio no te guardes＿nada, ¿sí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay. Thanks for asking.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien. Gracias por preguntar.」"

msgid "Ami「Thanks for keeping me company＿today～ I had LOTS of fun!」"
msgstr "Ami「Gracias por hacerme compañía＿hoy～ ¡Me divertí MUCHÍSIMO!」"

msgid "Ami「See you later, Takasu-kun①」"
msgstr "Ami「Nos vemos luego, Takasu-kun①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, later.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, nos vemos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Weren't you in a pro wrestling show?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No estuviste en un show de lucha libre?」"

msgid "Ami「Pro wrestling show? You can ask＿Ami-chan anything, and yet you ask＿about a pro wrestling show!?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Un show de lucha libre? ¡¿Le puedes＿preguntar a Ami-chan lo que sea, y＿preguntas sobre lucha libre?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What the? All of a sudden her＿personality changed......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué diablos? De repente le cambió＿la personalidad......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I got this script from Noto.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, Noto me dio este guion.」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, I see～ That was so out of the blue＿that, like, it caught Ami-chan off-guard.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah, ya veo～ Fue tan de la nada que, o＿sea, tomó desprevenida a Ami-chan.」"

msgid "Ami「Ami-chan was in it, yeah. See, my＿name's written here, like, isn't it?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ami-chan sí estuvo, ajá. Mira, mi＿nombre está escrito aquí, ¿ves?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, you had the leading role!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah, tenías el papel principal!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga was the devil incarnate, and I＿was her minion......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga era la encarnación del demonio,＿y yo era su secuaz......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......*Gasp*!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¡Ah!）」"

msgid "Ami「Stupid violent stunted-growth midget＿Palmtop Tiger and her punk-face＿minion who acts like an old lady!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Estúpida y violenta enana raquítica,＿Tigre Compacto, y su secuaz cara de＿delincuente que actúa como anciana!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I remember now...... This is a scene＿from our pro wrestling show at the＿Culture Festival!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ya lo recuerdo...... ¡Es una escena＿de nuestro show de lucha libre en＿el Festival Cultural!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Goddamn Kawashima spouted a＿tangent of insults that weren't written＿in the script.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（La maldita de Kawashima soltó＿toda una sarta de insultos que＿ni estaban en el guion.）」"

msgid "Ami「I was like, SUPER embarrassed to play＿the leading role～」"
msgstr "Ami「Me daba, o sea, SÚPER vergüenza＿hacer el papel principal～」"

msgid "Ami「But since I got to do it with you, I was＿able to make some wonderful＿memories①」"
msgstr "Ami「Pero como pude hacerlo contigo, logré＿crear unos recuerdos maravillosos①」"

msgid "Ami「Thinking back, it was around that time＿that we were able to, like, close the＿distance between our hearts......」"
msgstr "Ami「Pensándolo bien, fue por esa época que＿pudimos, o sea, acortar la distancia＿entre nuestros corazones......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima, you can drop your little＿act.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kawashima, ya puedes dejar ese teatrito.」"

msgid "Ami「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Because I remember now. Your true＿nature. I nearly fell for it, too.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Porque ya recuerdo. Tu verdadera＿naturaleza. Por poco me lo creo también.」"

msgid "Ami「......」"
msgstr "Ami「......」"

msgid "Ami「......Well now, that's boring.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Vaya, qué aburrido.」"

msgid "Ami「And here I was thinking I could make＿fun of Tiger.」"
msgstr "Ami「Y yo que pensaba que podría＿burlarme de Tigre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why'd you bring up Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué sacaste el tema de Taiga?」"

msgid "Ami「Who knows. Did you remember＿anything besides my personality?」"
msgstr "Ami「Quién sabe. ¿Recordaste algo más＿aparte de mi personalidad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No.」"

msgid "Ami「I see...... why do you only remember＿that part?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ya veo...... ¿por qué solo＿recuerdas esa parte?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Say...... about that story of my＿confession on Christmas Eve......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye...... sobre esa historia de mi＿confesión en Nochebuena......」"

msgid "Ami「That part really happened.」"
msgstr "Ami「Esa parte sí pasó de verdad.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Eh?!」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu...... I lied①」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju...... Mentí①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima...... Please don't jerk me＿around anymore.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kawashima...... Por favor,＿no juegues más conmigo.」"

msgid "Ami「But something probably did happen to＿you that day, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Ami「Pero probablemente sí te pasó＿algo ese día, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Do you know about it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Sabes qué fue?」"

msgid "Ami「Nope, no clue. Nothing to do with me,＿you know.」"
msgstr "Ami「Nop, ni idea. No tiene nada＿que ver conmigo, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, are you trying to hint at＿something?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué, acaso intentas insinuarme algo?」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, it's this late already～ Silly＿Ami-chan, I'm like, SUPER busy～ I＿gotta run～ See ya!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Ay, ya es tan tarde～! Qué tonta es＿Ami-chan, estoy, o sea, SÚPER ocupada～＿¡Me tengo que ir～ Nos vemos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Kawashima Ami...... She's a force to be＿reckoned with. I'll have to be careful.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Kawashima Ami...... Es de cuidado.＿Tendré que estar alerta.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Ohh...... Now that I'm alone, suddenly......＿That desire......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ohh...... Ahora que estoy solo, de＿repente...... Ese impulso......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I, I...... I want to clean something!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Y-Yo...... Quiero limpiar algo!）」"

msgid "Don't clean"
msgstr "No limpiar"

msgid "Clean"
msgstr "Limpiar"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No no no, it's a waste of time to do it＿here. If I do it, it should be in my own＿house.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No, no, no, es una pérdida de tiempo＿hacerlo aquí. Si lo hago, debería＿ser en mi propia casa.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Just a little bit. I'll go home after a＿little cleaning.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Solo un poco. Me iré a casa＿después de limpiar un poco.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Hmmm?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Hmmm?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（This is......! A camera. It seems to be＿broken. No point in having it, really......＿but on the other hand!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Esto es......! Una cámara. Parece＿estar rota. No sirve de mucho, la＿verdad...... ¡pero por otro lado!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（ARGH, SO WASTEFUL......＿MOTTAINAI...... so!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（AAARGH, QUÉ DESPERDICIO......＿MOTTAINAI...... ¡así que!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......I'll pick it up. Perhaps it will work＿again if I have it repaired.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......La recogeré. Quizá vuelva a＿funcionar si la mando a reparar.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Huh, is this......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Eh, ¿esto es......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（An umbrella......? It's also completely＿broken, but this is beyond repair.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Un paraguas......? También＿está del todo roto, pero este＿no tiene arreglo.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No choice but to dispose of it......＿However, I have to properly separate＿the metallic portion from the cloth.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No queda más que desecharlo......＿Pero debo separar bien la parte＿metálica de la tela.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Couldn't find anything......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No pude encontrar nada......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Well, it should be fine.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Bueno, debería estar bien.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, my memories from before I was＿hospitalized had been completely＿wiped out...... including Christmas Eve.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, mis recuerdos de antes de ser＿hospitalizado se borraron por＿completo...... incluida Nochebuena.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I really can't remember anything about＿it...... I'm so sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En serio no logro recordar nada＿de eso...... Lo siento mucho.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I can hear the screaming souls of the＿factory workers who made this camera＿with their utmost effort......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Puedo oír los gritos de las almas de＿los obreros que fabricaron esta cámara＿con su máximo esfuerzo......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（If I listen carefully, it's coming from＿beyond the distant sea......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Si presto atención, vienen desde＿más allá del mar lejano......）」"
